      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.93 (down from ₹6.92 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹27.3b (down 1.8% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹619.6m (down 19% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 2.3% (down from 2.7% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 17% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 8% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
