      "date": "2026-05-27T12:52:00.000Z",
      "title": "Himatsingka Seide Limited Recommends Final Dividend for the Financial Year Ended 2025-26",
      "body": "Himatsingka Seide Limited at the board meeting held on May 27, 2026, Recommended Final Dividend of INR 0.25 per equity share (5%) of face value INR 5/- each for the Financial Year ended 2025-26, subject to the approval of shareholders at the ensuing Annual General Meeting of the Company.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "45",
